Ready and...

17
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Here we go!

18
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Zero Zero 48!

19
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
No, no

20
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,000
No, no

21
